# Lightning Web Components (LWC) in Salesforce

# 1. What is LWC?

LWC (Lightning Web Components) is a modern Salesforce UI development framework used to build fast and reusable user interfaces.

It is based on:
- HTML
- JavaScript
- CSS

LWC helps developers create responsive and interactive applications on the Salesforce platform.

---

# 2. Why Salesforce Uses LWC

Salesforce uses LWC because it provides:
- Faster performance
- Reusable components
- Modern web standards
- Better user experience
- Improved security
- Easier maintenance

LWC is lightweight and works efficiently in enterprise applications.

