# 4. Component Breakdown

| Component | Purpose |
|---|---|
| StudentFormComponent | Handles student registration |
| AttendanceComponent | Displays attendance details |
| CourseComponent | Manages course enrollment |
| FeeComponent | Displays fee information |
| DashboardComponent | Shows analytics and reports |

---

# 5. Frontend vs Backend Logic

| Frontend Logic | Backend Logic |
|---|---|
| User interface design | Business processing |
| HTML, CSS, JavaScript | Apex classes and database logic |
| Displays data to users | Handles calculations and automation |
| User interactions | Data storage and validations |
| LWC Components | Apex & Salesforce Database |

