# 6. Reflection

LWC is important in enterprise systems because modern applications require fast, responsive, and user-friendly interfaces. It improves user experience and makes applications more interactive.

By combining LWC frontend development with Apex backend processing, Salesforce can build scalable and powerful enterprise applications efficiently.
